/*
 * Linux-specific notes for DCE Threads.
 *
 * PORTING_GUIDE.pdf chapter 4.1: Linux NPTL is a kernel-thread POSIX
 * pthreads library, so this port does not compile CMA user-level
 * context-switch assembly (cma_assem.s). The draft-4 DCE pthread API
 * and TRY/CATCH package live in linux/src/dcethreads.c.
 */
